# Expense Tracker — MERN Project Architecture

## 1. Project Overview

The Expense Tracker is a beginner-friendly full-stack MERN application for recording and managing personal expenses.

The application will allow a user to:
- Add an expense
- View all expenses
- Edit an expense
- Delete an expense
- Categorize an expense
- Record the amount and date
- Filter expenses by category
- View total spending

The project is intentionally kept simple so that each feature can be developed, inspected, tested, and committed separately with the help of an AI coding agent.

