## 5. Simple Architecture

```text
                    Expense Tracker
                           |
             +-------------+-------------+
             |                           |
        React Frontend              Express Backend
             |                           |
             | HTTP REST API             |
             +-------------------------->|
                                         |
                                      Mongoose
                                         |
                                         v
                                  MongoDB Atlas
```

### Frontend Responsibilities
- Display the user interface
- Collect expense information
- Validate basic user input
- Send HTTP requests to the backend
- Display expenses and totals
- Display API errors to the user

### Backend Responsibilities
- Define REST API routes
- Validate incoming expense data
- Perform CRUD operations
- Communicate with MongoDB using Mongoose
- Return appropriate HTTP responses

### Database Responsibilities
- Persist expense documents

