## 6. Data Model

MongoDB collection:

```text
expenses
```

Expense document:

```javascript
{
  _id: ObjectId,
  description: String,
  amount: Number,
  category: String,
  date: Date,
  createdAt: Date,
  updatedAt: Date
}
```

### Field Rules

| Field | Type | Required | Rules |
|---|---|---|---|
| description | String | Yes | Cannot be empty or spaces-only |
| amount | Number | Yes | Must be greater than 0 |
| category | String | Yes | Must be one of the allowed categories |
| date | Date | Yes | Must be a valid date |
| createdAt | Date | Automatic | Generated by Mongoose timestamps |
| updatedAt | Date | Automatic | Generated by Mongoose timestamps |

### Initial Categories

Keep the category list small:

```text
Food
Transport
Shopping
Bills
Entertainment
Other
```

