## 7. API Design

Base URL:

```text
/api/expenses
```

### Create Expense

```http
POST /api/expenses
```

Request body:

```json
{
  "description": "Lunch",
  "amount": 250,
  "category": "Food",
  "date": "2026-09-30"
}
```

### Get All Expenses

```http
GET /api/expenses
```

### Filter by Category

```http
GET /api/expenses?category=Food
```

### Get One Expense

```http
GET /api/expenses/:id
```

### Update Expense

```http
PUT /api/expenses/:id
```

### Delete Expense

```http
DELETE /api/expenses/:id
```

