## 14. Testing Strategy

For every feature, test both normal and edge-case inputs.

Example tests for creating an expense:

| Input | Expected Result |
|---|---|
| Lunch, 250, Food | Expense saved |
| Dinner, 500, Food | Expense saved |
| Empty description | Rejected |
| Spaces-only description | Rejected |
| Amount = 0 | Rejected |
| Amount = -100 | Rejected |
| Amount = "abc" | Rejected |
| Invalid category | Rejected |

Generated tests from the AI coding agent must be read and understood before being used.

