## 17. Deployment Plan

### Backend
Deploy the `backend` directory as a Render Web Service.

Expected settings:

```text
Root Directory: backend
Build Command: npm install
Start Command: node server.js
```

Environment variables will be entered in Render's dashboard.

### Frontend
Deploy the `frontend` directory as a Render Static Site.

Expected settings:

```text
Root Directory: frontend
Build Command: npm run build
Publish Directory: dist
```

The frontend will use the deployed backend URL.

If client-side routing is introduced, configure the Render rewrite:

```text
Source: /*
Destination: /index.html
Action: Rewrite
```

